{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此二皆下經文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言成佛不久也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〈藥王品〉云「受持此經，即往生安樂世界」等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "普賢十大願，結云「臨命終時，一剎那中，即得往生極樂世界」等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上皆彼文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經云「一心繫念諦觀彼佛」，天台疏云「落日懸鞁，用標送想之方」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "義通餘儀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "觀佛經云「除便轉時」，地觀云「唯除食時」等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上並《玄義》中文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂天魔也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上明此方入道則發魔事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上彼文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂現通時現作嬰兒食闍世唾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "丈寸"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不壞內身骨人，\n而觀外色不淨，此位在初禪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "壞滅內骨人，觀外不淨，得入二禪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "除外不淨，定心清潔，名緣淨。以無著心受三禪樂，名身證"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "滅四禪色心，緣無邊空而入定，知無常苦空，心厭背故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "捨空，緣識入定，知無常，生厭背"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "捨識，緣無所有入定，知無常，生\n厭背"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "捨無所有，緣非非想入定，知無常，生厭背"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "背滅受，捨諸心心數法，入定休息，名背捨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛知說法因緣果報，從是\n因不生是果，佛悉遍知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛知一切眾生三世諸業因緣果報"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛知\n一切諸佛三昧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛知他眾生諸根上下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛知眾生種種樂欲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛知世間種種性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛知一切道至處相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛知\n種種宿命，一世二世乃至百千世劫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛天眼淨，見眾生生死業報等相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛諸漏盡，故無漏心解脫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
